# MusicBrainz song enrichment (full track-lists: album tracks + B-sides that Wikidata lacks).
# Opt-in and SEPARATE from the Wikidata refresh because it is slow (≤1 req/s → minutes for the
# full set). When enabled, the K-pop refresh also fetches each group's recordings from MusicBrainz
# (bridged via the group's Wikidata MusicBrainz id, P434) and merges them into the group's songs.
# Requires outbound access to musicbrainz.org (allowlist it) and a descriptive User-Agent.
MUSICBRAINZ_REFRESH_ENABLED=true
# Descriptive User-Agent sent to MusicBrainz (include contact/repo URL) — required by their ToS.
MUSICBRAINZ_USER_AGENT=VidPulse-KpopDB/1.0 (+https://github.com/ilikosov/vidpulse)
# Minimum ms between MusicBrainz requests (≤1 req/s per their policy).
MUSICBRAINZ_RATE_LIMIT_MS=1000
# Optional cap on the number of groups enriched per refresh (omit for no cap).
# MUSICBRAINZ_LIMIT=100